  "slug": "furry-fiesta",
  "name": "Texas Furry Fiesta",
  "shortName": "TFF",
  "description": "Furry Fiesta, also called Texas Furry Fiesta (TFF), is an annual furry convention in Dallas, Texas, held each February to April. The first Furry Fiesta took place February 20 to 22, 2009, at the Crowne Plaza Dallas, organized by the Dallas Regional Anthropomorphic Meeting Association (DRAMA), a non-profit formed in 2008. In 2018 DRAMA was dissolved and its assets passed to Creature Arts, a 501(c)(3) that now runs Furry Fiesta and its sister event Furry Siesta. The convention moved to the InterContinental Dallas in 2014, the Hyatt Regency Dallas in 2018 and the Sheraton Dallas from 2022. Its charity is the Center for Animal Research and Education (CARE). Attendance has grown from 561 in 2009 to over 9,000 in 2026.",
